WEBVTT

01:45.680 --> 01:46.280
Xing Wu.

01:46.280 --> 01:47.000
Well, I...

01:47.360 --> 01:47.840
What's wrong?

01:48.920 --> 01:50.960
There's... there's... there's a bug!

01:51.720 --> 01:52.320
A bug!

01:52.800 --> 01:54.000
Lots of big bugs!

01:59.800 --> 02:00.800
Did you see them?

02:01.440 --> 02:02.320
There are no big bugs.

02:02.600 --> 02:03.560
There were so many!

02:03.760 --> 02:04.400
This one?

02:05.440 --> 02:07.320
Don't— Take it away from me.

02:10.199 --> 02:11.360
What's the big fuss?

02:12.280 --> 02:13.320
Just let it go?

02:13.600 --> 02:14.600
You screamed so loud,

02:14.960 --> 02:16.480
and scared all its buddies away.

02:17.280 --> 02:17.800
It's fine.

02:18.440 --> 02:19.680
After a few more encounters, you'll get used to it.

02:20.600 --> 02:21.240
Hurry up and wash.

02:42.800 --> 02:43.600
It's so hot.

02:47.920 --> 02:48.560
Aren't you hot?

02:49.120 --> 02:50.280
There's the sea breeze outside.

02:50.520 --> 02:51.520
And there's a fan in the room.

02:52.360 --> 02:52.760
Not hot.

02:59.800 --> 03:01.200
Air conditioning is so much cooler.

03:01.200 --> 03:02.320
Why don't you install an air conditioner?

03:02.440 --> 03:03.640
A calm heart keeps you cool.

03:06.000 --> 03:06.760
If you're really hot,

03:07.320 --> 03:07.920
take the fan.

03:08.520 --> 03:08.880
By the way,

03:08.880 --> 03:09.800
a second-hand air conditioner...

03:09.800 --> 03:10.800
...shouldn't cost much, right?

03:11.280 --> 03:11.760
How about this:

03:12.000 --> 03:13.640
we split the cost and buy one together.

03:14.000 --> 03:15.040
After I leave,

03:15.040 --> 03:15.800
you can still have it.

03:16.520 --> 03:17.040
A win-win.

03:21.520 --> 03:22.920
I think that's a pretty good idea.

03:23.320 --> 03:24.520
Given the conditions in Zhazhating,

03:24.880 --> 03:25.760
if you had the money,

03:26.200 --> 03:27.880
you could install one for every household,

03:28.320 --> 03:29.079
benefitting the whole community.

03:29.680 --> 03:30.120
How about that?

03:57.240 --> 03:58.320
Are you going to sleep?

04:00.080 --> 04:00.800
You're not asleep?

04:01.360 --> 04:03.000
Your mom said you wouldn't be back to sleep.

04:04.440 --> 04:06.040
You believe everything my mom says?

04:06.760 --> 04:08.320
No, I meant...

04:09.120 --> 04:10.800
...are you planning to sleep here tonight?

04:29.640 --> 04:31.360
You're not actually planning to sleep here, are you?

04:33.120 --> 04:34.000
I think the two of us...

04:36.360 --> 04:37.159
What about the two of us?

04:39.280 --> 04:40.760
The two of us shouldn't be sharing a room.

04:54.000 --> 04:54.920
I think so too.

05:20.040 --> 05:20.800
[Are you asleep?]

05:21.320 --> 05:22.080
[How are you feeling?]

05:22.440 --> 05:23.080
[Getting used to it?]

05:30.080 --> 05:32.880
[PUBG— more like land and die.]

05:38.159 --> 05:39.280
[Feels like you've gone back]

05:39.280 --> 05:40.240
[twenty years.]

05:42.800 --> 05:44.560
[Just get through this month, and then I'm going abroad.]

05:47.560 --> 05:49.840
[By the way, did you send the package?]

05:50.159 --> 05:51.560
[The tracking number and the picture.]

05:52.360 --> 05:54.159
[Sent it express. Keep an eye out for it.]

05:54.400 --> 05:54.880
[Also,]

05:55.280 --> 05:56.800
[the course selection application needs a video recording.]

05:56.960 --> 05:57.520
[Don't forget.]

05:57.920 --> 05:59.120
[If there's anything you need my help with,]

05:59.200 --> 05:59.960
[I'm always here.]

06:02.120 --> 06:03.440
[Actually, when I first arrived here,]

06:03.600 --> 06:04.880
[I wanted to go back to Beijing.]

06:09.120 --> 06:10.160
[It's probably pretty hard for you]

06:10.200 --> 06:11.120
[to go back to Beijing now, isn't it?]

06:43.280 --> 06:43.880
[Wu.]

06:44.159 --> 06:45.560
[How's it going with our cousin?]

06:48.640 --> 06:49.880
[A girl from the big city—]

06:49.880 --> 06:51.080
[she's really something else, huh?]

06:52.800 --> 06:53.520
[Now go wash up and get to bed.]

08:06.320 --> 08:07.200
Coming.

08:08.240 --> 08:10.280
Sweet tofu pudding, millet porridge,

08:10.320 --> 08:10.960
pickled vegetables.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.000
By the window.

08:14.080 --> 08:15.520
For breakfast we've got baozi, wontons,

08:15.520 --> 08:16.200
youtiao, tofu pudding.

08:16.200 --> 08:16.720
What would you like?

08:16.720 --> 08:18.280
One large bowl of three-delicacy wontons,

08:18.280 --> 08:19.520
extra seaweed and dried shrimp, Aunt Jin.

08:19.960 --> 08:20.520
Aunt Jin!

08:20.520 --> 08:21.360
Extra seaweed and dried shrimp!

08:21.440 --> 08:22.320
My mom sent me to buy

08:22.320 --> 08:23.520
cabbage and pork dumplings.

08:23.560 --> 08:24.240
I need thirty.

08:24.280 --> 08:25.080
Thirty, deal!

08:25.440 --> 08:26.240
Okay, come pick them up at noon.

08:29.880 --> 08:30.520
Honey,

08:31.280 --> 08:32.520
has Big G taken his medicine this morning?

08:33.039 --> 08:33.400
Well...

08:33.960 --> 08:34.799
He complains it's bitter.

08:35.799 --> 08:37.120
"Only by enduring the bitterest of the bitter

08:37.120 --> 08:38.400
can one rise above all others."

08:38.640 --> 08:39.520
If he doesn't endure a little bitterness,

08:39.520 --> 08:40.840
how can his stuttering ever be cured?

08:41.120 --> 08:42.039
Don't the books also say...

08:42.039 --> 08:43.240
..."every medicine has a little poison in it"?

08:43.960 --> 08:45.040
Can't count on you for anything!

08:45.040 --> 08:45.680
From now on, I'll supervise it myself.

08:45.680 --> 08:47.400
Selling tofu!

08:48.840 --> 08:49.640
Watch where you're walking!

08:49.880 --> 08:50.680
You, honestly!

08:50.840 --> 08:51.360
What are you doing?

08:51.360 --> 08:52.440
Look how you were walking!

08:53.120 --> 08:53.800
Now, watch how I ride my bike.

08:53.800 --> 08:54.880
Move, move aside!

08:54.880 --> 08:55.720
How can you just...?

08:55.720 --> 08:56.880
What's with the way you walk?

08:57.720 --> 08:58.280
Quickly!

08:58.760 --> 08:59.240
Quickly!

09:00.520 --> 09:01.120
Hurry up and pay for it!

09:01.360 --> 09:02.000
Pay up and settle this!

09:03.920 --> 09:04.880
You just don't know how to walk!

09:04.880 --> 09:05.480
Look at this!

09:05.680 --> 09:06.480
Hurry up and pay!

09:06.760 --> 09:07.600
Money settles the matter!

09:08.400 --> 09:09.240
Pay up! Pay up!

09:09.360 --> 09:10.800
You're not leaving today without paying!

09:12.160 --> 09:14.000
What's all this racket so early in the morning?

09:14.520 --> 09:15.400
You're disturbing the peace!

09:15.400 --> 09:16.280
I can call the police!

09:16.280 --> 09:16.960
You know that?

09:18.240 --> 09:18.640
She...

09:19.400 --> 09:20.360
She says she's going to call the police.

09:20.760 --> 09:21.520
Call the police to arrest who?

09:21.520 --> 09:23.200
This young lady is from the big city—

09:23.200 --> 09:24.520
she's got more fire in her than all of you.

09:25.280 --> 09:25.960
Break it up, break it up, break it up.

09:26.280 --> 09:26.880
That won't do.

09:27.000 --> 09:28.040
This tofu can't be sold now!

09:28.040 --> 09:29.440
I'll take all your tofu.

09:53.440 --> 09:54.720
Ow, ow, ow! It hurts!

09:55.120 --> 09:55.960
What's going on?

09:56.880 --> 09:57.680
Didn't see.

09:59.840 --> 10:00.280
What's wrong?

10:00.520 --> 10:00.960
No, no, no.

10:01.160 --> 10:01.600
No!

10:01.600 --> 10:02.560
I haven't even touched it yet!

10:02.800 --> 10:03.920
Here, help her up, help her up.

10:03.920 --> 10:05.160
I didn't even touch you, and you're already "ow, ow, ow"?

10:05.520 --> 10:06.360
The foot, the foot, the foot!

10:07.960 --> 10:08.800
Gently!

10:08.840 --> 10:09.840
A little gentler!

10:09.840 --> 10:10.600
I'll be gentle, I'll be gentle.

10:10.600 --> 10:11.200
It hurts!

10:11.200 --> 10:11.920
Hang in there a moment.

10:11.920 --> 10:12.440
Where else does it hurt?

10:12.440 --> 10:12.960
Get up a little.

10:13.280 --> 10:14.360
Slowly, slowly— okay, okay, okay.

10:14.880 --> 10:15.800
Take it easy, take it easy.

10:16.000 --> 10:17.960
Seriously, ow, ow, ow! It hurts!

10:18.120 --> 10:19.080
Okay, okay, okay. All right.

10:19.520 --> 10:20.200
Slowly, slowly.

10:20.280 --> 10:20.960
It can't bend over.

10:25.080 --> 10:26.080
Where did you hit yourself?

10:28.240 --> 10:29.280
The pain is killing me!

10:30.120 --> 10:31.000
It hurts so much, Ye.

10:32.360 --> 10:33.240
Your eye...

10:34.120 --> 10:35.400
...looks just like an Ertong.

10:35.840 --> 10:36.200
My—

10:40.200 --> 10:41.560
What's wrong with my eye?

10:41.600 --> 10:42.400
How did this happen?

10:43.440 --> 10:44.200
Don't touch it with your hands!

10:44.760 --> 10:45.240
This, this, this...

10:46.080 --> 10:46.760
What is going on here?

10:46.760 --> 10:47.600
Your eye—

10:47.600 --> 10:49.240
...must've got mosquito bites.

10:49.400 --> 10:50.880
This one here is probably inflamed, an allergic reaction.

10:51.320 --> 10:52.360
Then what do we do? I...

10:53.240 --> 10:54.160
Why do I feel like right now...

10:54.160 --> 10:54.760
...I can barely see things clearly?

10:54.760 --> 10:55.880
My eyesight is better than average.

10:55.880 --> 10:57.440
I'm going blind, am I?

10:57.440 --> 10:58.080
Just shut your mouth!

10:58.080 --> 10:59.080
My home isn't that toxic.

10:59.120 --> 10:59.720
You won't go blind.

11:00.000 --> 11:01.080
Then what do we do now?

11:01.080 --> 11:01.560
It's fine, it's fine.

11:01.560 --> 11:02.840
Hurry up and go to the hospital to get it checked.

11:03.840 --> 11:04.240
Well...

11:04.520 --> 11:06.040
...my ID card is still upstairs.

11:06.200 --> 11:06.880
Stop rubbing it.

11:06.880 --> 11:07.800
Just you going is enough.

11:07.880 --> 11:08.240
Right.

11:08.520 --> 11:08.840
Then I...

11:08.960 --> 11:10.280
...I at least need to go up and change.

11:10.280 --> 11:11.360
I can't go out in my pajamas.

11:11.360 --> 11:12.240
How embarrassing!

11:12.240 --> 11:13.280
Out... out on the street?

11:13.360 --> 11:13.960
No need.

11:13.960 --> 11:14.920
Nobody here cares what you wear.

11:14.920 --> 11:15.320
Right.

11:15.400 --> 11:15.760
Well...

11:16.160 --> 11:16.920
...how about this, Auntie:

11:16.920 --> 11:18.040
could you get me a pair of sunglasses?

11:18.160 --> 11:19.120
Sun-sun-sun...

11:19.640 --> 11:21.080
What sunglasses? Any more dawdling and you'll really go blind!

11:49.400 --> 11:50.520
Hurry and put me down!

11:50.520 --> 11:51.800
This is so humiliating!

11:52.120 --> 11:53.000
Oh my God— just cover your face.

11:53.000 --> 11:54.040
Then nobody will recognize you.

11:54.680 --> 11:56.040
Help! I seriously...

12:06.520 --> 12:07.600
Put me down.

12:07.640 --> 12:08.360
Dr. Zhuang!

12:08.760 --> 12:09.800
Someone is dying!

12:09.920 --> 12:11.000
You're the one who's dying!

12:11.600 --> 12:13.440
Is it really okay to bring me to this little clinic?

12:13.760 --> 12:14.520
In Zhazhating,

12:14.680 --> 12:15.880
this is a top-tier hospital.

12:17.120 --> 12:17.600
I still want to go

12:17.600 --> 12:18.640
to a real top-tier hospital.

12:19.280 --> 12:19.680
Fine.

12:20.360 --> 12:21.720
Five-minute walk to the bus stop,

12:21.760 --> 12:22.880
forty-minute bus ride,

12:22.960 --> 12:23.840
then another twenty-minute walk.

12:24.320 --> 12:25.360
It's only about thirty or forty kilometers away.

12:25.440 --> 12:26.000
Walk there yourself.

12:26.520 --> 12:27.320
You're lying!

12:29.040 --> 12:30.600
Princess, stop being so dramatic.

12:31.520 --> 12:32.800
This is just how Zhazhating is.

12:39.400 --> 12:40.440
So early in the morning,

12:41.200 --> 12:42.520
what's wrong? Who's dying?

12:43.120 --> 12:43.520
Her.

12:43.840 --> 12:45.040
- She's dying...
- You're dying!

12:46.120 --> 12:46.760
Nonsense!

12:46.840 --> 12:47.520
What's wrong with you?

12:48.360 --> 12:49.280
Please, take a look at her, quick!

12:50.400 --> 12:51.520
Her eye's about to go blind, and her leg's about to break!

12:52.760 --> 12:53.200
This...

12:54.600 --> 12:55.680
More nonsense.

12:58.400 --> 12:59.520
Come, come, come. Let me take a look.

13:00.120 --> 13:01.160
Open your eyes and let me see.

13:03.120 --> 13:03.960
Open your eyes.

13:05.960 --> 13:06.640
Come on, open them.

13:07.720 --> 13:08.360
Look up.

13:08.960 --> 13:09.640
Look down.

13:11.000 --> 13:11.720
Look left.

13:13.120 --> 13:13.680
Doctor,

13:14.200 --> 13:15.520
is just looking really enough?

13:15.520 --> 13:16.520
Shouldn't I first get a blood test,

13:16.520 --> 13:17.760
then an X-ray,

13:18.120 --> 13:19.120
a CT scan, or something like that?

13:19.240 --> 13:19.680
No need.

13:20.520 --> 13:21.560
Your right eye...

13:21.960 --> 13:22.880
...was pressed while you slept.

13:23.640 --> 13:25.080
Your left eye was bitten by a mosquito.

13:28.680 --> 13:29.440
What did I tell you?

13:31.520 --> 13:32.200
So... so...

13:32.400 --> 13:33.440
...how should it be treated?

13:33.960 --> 13:35.520
Just some eye drops, and it'll be fine.

13:36.960 --> 13:38.600
No injection? No oral medicine for inflammation?

13:39.240 --> 13:40.080
What injection?

13:40.720 --> 13:41.360
What medicine?

13:41.840 --> 13:42.960
Young people shouldn't go treating themselves

13:42.960 --> 13:43.680
like invalids.

13:44.040 --> 13:44.440
Just be careful

13:44.520 --> 13:46.040
not to rub your eyes the next couple of days.

13:48.120 --> 13:49.320
Wait— wait a moment, Doctor.

13:49.520 --> 13:49.800
My...

13:50.280 --> 13:52.000
...my leg is messed up too. Who's looking at that?

13:52.320 --> 13:53.040
Your leg's injured too?

13:53.640 --> 13:54.200
Let me see.

13:55.320 --> 13:55.880
Wait, wait, wait!

13:56.160 --> 13:57.200
You're still the one looking at it?

13:57.520 --> 13:59.000
Don't I need to get an X-ray first?

13:59.880 --> 14:01.600
I've got to take a look first, then we'll see.

14:01.840 --> 14:03.080
Those that swim in the water, those that fly in the sky,

14:03.080 --> 14:03.960
those that walk on the ground—

14:04.080 --> 14:05.080
Dr. Zhuang can treat them all.

14:05.280 --> 14:06.080
He's even brought back poisoned wolfdogs

14:06.080 --> 14:07.120
and saved two of them.

14:08.640 --> 14:10.400
Is he a doctor or a veterinarian?

14:10.560 --> 14:12.080
Th-this... don't listen to him!

14:12.600 --> 14:13.720
I'm licensed.

14:14.600 --> 14:15.440
Come, come, let me see.

14:17.520 --> 14:18.720
Ow, ow, ow! Ow, ow, ow!

14:24.240 --> 14:24.920
Right here...

14:25.600 --> 14:27.280
...you just accidentally bumped it.

14:27.800 --> 14:28.520
It's a superficial wound.

14:28.600 --> 14:29.360
The bone is fine.

14:29.880 --> 14:31.080
But it hurts!

14:31.320 --> 14:32.360
Whether my bone is fine or not—

14:32.440 --> 14:33.960
don't you need an X-ray to know that?

14:33.960 --> 14:35.600
I say it's fine, so it's fine.

14:36.000 --> 14:37.520
You just accidentally knocked it.

14:37.680 --> 14:38.640
Just be careful these next couple of days

14:38.760 --> 14:39.800
to stay off it as much as possible.

14:40.000 --> 14:41.040
Apply some iodine,

14:41.320 --> 14:41.880
put some ointment on it,

14:42.120 --> 14:42.880
and it'll heal up.

14:44.240 --> 14:44.760
Here, Wu,

14:44.960 --> 14:46.040
come with me to get the medicine.

14:57.400 --> 14:58.840
What's this young girl to you?

15:00.600 --> 15:01.120
Foremother.

15:02.440 --> 15:03.240
Nonsense again.

15:04.360 --> 15:04.960
A cousin.

15:05.640 --> 15:06.560
It's her first time here.

15:06.920 --> 15:08.160
She makes a big fuss over everything.

15:10.000 --> 15:11.400
Here's the young lady's medicine.

15:12.040 --> 15:12.840
Every twelve hours,

15:12.840 --> 15:13.640
change her dressing once.

15:15.520 --> 15:16.320
This is for your grandma—

15:16.320 --> 15:17.320
this month's medicine.

15:17.720 --> 15:18.800
Herbal medicine, to be taken orally.

15:18.920 --> 15:19.680
Ointment, for external use.

15:20.200 --> 15:20.560
All right.

15:21.520 --> 15:21.920
Okay!

15:22.320 --> 15:22.960
Thank you, Dr. Zhuang.

15:23.080 --> 15:23.600
Go on.

15:24.320 --> 15:25.600
Help the young lady apply the medicine.

15:35.720 --> 15:36.880
Come on, put your foot up here.

15:37.520 --> 15:38.040
What are you doing?

15:39.160 --> 15:40.040
Applying your medicine.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.160
The doctor doesn't do it?

15:42.200 --> 15:42.800
Young people...

15:42.800 --> 15:43.960
...shouldn't treat themselves like invalids.

15:44.360 --> 15:45.280
When you get back, you'll have to apply it yourself anyway.

15:47.520 --> 15:48.040
Put it up.

16:06.840 --> 16:07.360
It hurts!

16:40.160 --> 16:40.680
Wait a moment.

16:40.880 --> 16:41.440
What is this?

16:44.160 --> 16:46.160
It doesn't even have a label or approval license.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.000
Can this even be used?

16:47.680 --> 16:48.920
Dr. Zhuang's secret-formula ointment—

16:49.560 --> 16:50.840
specializes in treating sprains and bruises.

16:51.520 --> 16:52.000
It works.

17:28.840 --> 17:29.320
Done.

17:33.400 --> 17:34.240
Aren't we paying?

17:36.400 --> 17:36.800
No need.

17:37.840 --> 17:38.320
Put it on the tab.

17:39.600 --> 17:40.440
You can run a tab here?

17:42.560 --> 17:43.560
That's just how it is around here.

17:43.760 --> 17:44.560
Not only can you run a tab,

17:44.720 --> 17:45.360
but it's monthly billing.

17:48.280 --> 17:49.240
Let's add each other on WeChat.

17:49.840 --> 17:50.880
I'll send you the money for the medicine.

17:55.080 --> 17:56.120
If you don't want to add me, that's fine.

17:56.800 --> 17:57.680
I'll just have to track you down...

17:58.120 --> 17:58.880
...by shouting, I guess.

17:59.920 --> 18:01.280
Fine, adding me is fine too.

18:02.320 --> 18:03.040
Then, while you're at it,

18:03.040 --> 18:04.400
you might as well pay the travel fare here too.

18:05.000 --> 18:05.800
One yuan per step.

18:10.600 --> 18:11.040
Done.

18:24.040 --> 18:24.520
Let's go.

18:24.880 --> 18:25.720
Dr. Zhuang said

18:26.360 --> 18:27.520
I should avoid walking too much.

18:34.800 --> 18:35.200
Come on.

18:37.800 --> 18:39.040
One yuan per step is too expensive.

18:42.320 --> 18:43.040
The return trip is free.

18:49.640 --> 18:50.640
Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up!

18:50.640 --> 18:51.880
Don't let everyone see me!

18:52.640 --> 18:53.200
Faster!

18:55.160 --> 18:56.000
You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

18:56.000 --> 18:56.960
Are you going or not?

19:00.320 --> 19:01.320
Quick, quick, quick! Quick, quick, quick!

19:01.400 --> 19:02.160
Xing Wu!

19:04.400 --> 19:04.720
Wu.

19:04.720 --> 19:05.280
Auntie, good morning.

19:05.800 --> 19:06.560
What's going on here?

19:06.560 --> 19:06.960
This...

19:07.240 --> 19:08.120
Ye, your eye...!

19:08.120 --> 19:08.920
What happened to it?

19:09.040 --> 19:10.240
What happened to your foot?

19:11.120 --> 19:11.520
I...

19:11.960 --> 19:13.960
My eye got bitten, and I twisted my foot.

19:16.000 --> 19:16.600
Be careful, now!

19:16.840 --> 19:17.960
I'll take her back, then.

19:18.880 --> 19:19.520
Quickly.

19:19.600 --> 19:20.520
Take good care of yourself!

19:20.560 --> 19:22.000
Got... got medicine— take your medicine!

19:23.120 --> 19:23.600
Oh my God.

19:23.960 --> 19:25.000
I'm telling you, this young girl—

19:25.080 --> 19:26.000
when she arrived yesterday,

19:26.000 --> 19:27.160
she was all dressed up so exquisitely.

19:27.240 --> 19:28.560
And today, she can actually go out...

19:28.560 --> 19:29.080
...in her pajamas!

19:29.160 --> 19:30.120
And let Xing Wu carry her on his back!

19:30.320 --> 19:31.360
That's right.

19:31.840 --> 19:33.320
She adapts pretty fast, huh?

19:33.800 --> 19:34.960
You should see her this morning—

19:35.440 --> 19:36.680
she's already learned from Fang,

19:36.800 --> 19:37.720
yell and shout at the top of her lungs.

19:38.200 --> 19:38.920
Totally fierce.

19:38.920 --> 19:39.520
Seriously.

19:40.240 --> 19:41.240
She's one of us now.

19:41.240 --> 19:42.560
"When in Rome," right?

19:42.600 --> 19:42.960
Yeah.

19:44.480 --> 19:45.080
We're back.

19:45.240 --> 19:45.600
Mom.

19:45.680 --> 19:46.360
Come, come, come.

19:46.480 --> 19:46.760
Here.

19:49.680 --> 19:50.200
Careful now.

19:53.520 --> 19:54.160
Give this to me.

19:54.520 --> 19:54.840
Here.

19:56.400 --> 19:56.800
And up.

19:58.000 --> 19:58.440
Okay.

20:06.720 --> 20:07.720
What did Dr. Zhuang say?

20:08.440 --> 20:10.040
Dr. Zhuang's clinic doesn't have the resources to treat her.

20:10.880 --> 20:12.000
She needs to go to a big hospital in the city.

20:12.160 --> 20:13.760
Who knows, she might even need surgery.

20:14.120 --> 20:15.240
Amputation isn't out of the question either.

20:17.280 --> 20:18.400
That serious?

20:19.200 --> 20:20.440
It's all your fault!

20:20.800 --> 20:21.120
Well...

20:21.120 --> 20:21.920
...why didn't you properly

20:21.920 --> 20:23.080
take good care of your sister?

20:23.880 --> 20:25.120
Ye, I'm so sorry.

20:25.120 --> 20:26.360
It's not that serious.

20:26.760 --> 20:28.360
He's just talking nonsense.

20:28.960 --> 20:29.920
It's just some eye drops

20:29.920 --> 20:31.040
and applying some ointment, then will be fine.

20:34.960 --> 20:35.640
Oh, wonderful!

20:36.040 --> 20:37.240
It's such a relief it's not that serious.

20:37.400 --> 20:38.800
Well... well then, make sure to use the eye drops properly,

20:39.080 --> 20:40.000
and apply the ointment properly.

20:40.800 --> 20:42.960
And... I... I made a special trip next door

20:42.960 --> 20:44.840
to buy you baozi and youtiao,

20:45.280 --> 20:46.760
and I also simmered some pig trotter soup for you.

20:47.360 --> 20:48.320
You know, we "eat the part to nourish the part."

20:51.080 --> 20:51.640
It's fine.

20:54.320 --> 20:54.840
I'm not hungry.

20:57.800 --> 20:59.240
You don't need to worry about the final payment.

20:59.880 --> 21:01.680
It's not about any payment or final payment.

21:02.200 --> 21:02.880
I just...

21:03.200 --> 21:04.160
...as long as you're fine.

21:08.160 --> 21:08.680
I'm full.

21:09.280 --> 21:09.880
I'm heading to Shunyi for a bit.

21:11.840 --> 21:13.440
Okay, be careful on the road.

21:18.720 --> 21:20.080
What would you like to eat at noon?

21:20.240 --> 21:20.960
I'll make it for you.

21:22.320 --> 21:23.200
I haven't decided yet.

21:28.880 --> 21:30.720
How about you go order next door?

21:31.280 --> 21:32.200
The food next door is good.

21:34.160 --> 21:36.040
Later I'm going to the mahjong parlor

21:36.720 --> 21:37.360
to play some mahjong.

21:37.960 --> 21:39.640
If you need anything, just... just call for me.

21:39.800 --> 21:40.520
I'll be able to hear.

21:40.840 --> 21:41.240
Okay.

21:41.440 --> 21:42.000
Got it.

21:44.040 --> 21:45.320
I'd better go now.

22:47.880 --> 22:48.360
Here's the delivery.

22:49.520 --> 22:50.840
Contact the owners to come pick them up.

22:51.840 --> 22:52.640
So fast?

22:53.400 --> 22:54.000
Wu.

22:54.280 --> 22:55.560
You really aren't planning to join Shunyi as a partner?

22:56.040 --> 22:57.120
With our skills combined,

22:57.400 --> 22:58.920
we could dominate Anzi County.

23:00.240 --> 23:01.440
Shunyi only needs one boss,

23:01.440 --> 23:02.040
and that's you.

23:04.400 --> 23:04.960
Fair enough.

23:05.520 --> 23:06.640
All those people in Zhazhating,

23:06.760 --> 23:07.640
they're still counting on you.

23:14.960 --> 23:15.400
Quanya.

23:16.560 --> 23:18.040
If any jobs come up soon, just send them my way.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.000
Anything's fine.

23:19.440 --> 23:20.160
I'll even take house calls.

23:21.520 --> 23:22.280
Short on cash?

23:22.560 --> 23:23.240
Always short.

23:23.960 --> 23:25.040
Who ever earns enough money?

23:26.760 --> 23:27.360
Funny you should say that.

23:27.960 --> 23:28.760
This morning,

23:28.880 --> 23:29.600
a boss showed up.

23:31.840 --> 23:33.440
The phone's just the latest release.

23:34.160 --> 23:35.120
This model is too new.

23:35.720 --> 23:36.720
I can't fix it.

23:41.360 --> 23:41.920
Thanks.

23:48.800 --> 23:49.960
Seems like your luck with money is pretty good, huh?

24:12.360 --> 24:13.720
You're Qing Ye, right?

24:15.560 --> 24:17.400
I saw you when you were little.

24:17.720 --> 24:19.120
You've grown so much now.

24:21.160 --> 24:21.720
Grandma.

24:23.880 --> 24:24.800
Grandma, from now on,

24:25.240 --> 24:26.720
if there's anything you need help with,

24:26.720 --> 24:27.680
you can always tell me.

24:27.800 --> 24:28.120
Okay.

24:28.120 --> 24:28.840
I'm going to be staying here

24:28.840 --> 24:29.960
for a period of time.

24:30.160 --> 24:31.120
I'll be in your care.

24:31.600 --> 24:33.600
Okay, thank you.

24:36.280 --> 24:37.560
What happened to your eye?

24:40.520 --> 24:41.320
A mosquito bit.

24:43.240 --> 24:43.600
And...

24:43.720 --> 24:46.040
...your... your foot is injured too?

24:46.320 --> 24:46.920
It's nothing.

24:47.240 --> 24:48.120
I just took a tumble.

24:48.560 --> 24:49.040
Um...

24:49.920 --> 24:50.400
Grandma...

24:51.280 --> 24:52.320
Grandma, let me pour you some water.

24:52.920 --> 24:54.160
Okay, okay, okay.

24:55.360 --> 24:55.720
Okay.

24:56.880 --> 24:57.360
Okay.

24:58.080 --> 24:58.960
Thank you.

24:59.440 --> 24:59.880
It's nothing.

25:00.240 --> 25:01.520
Such a good kid.

25:03.240 --> 25:03.760
So...

25:04.400 --> 25:05.520
...if you need anything, just call for me.

25:05.880 --> 25:06.240
Okay.

25:06.960 --> 25:07.480
I'll head upstairs.

25:07.760 --> 25:08.200
Okay.

25:10.160 --> 25:11.240
Go rest up.

25:11.400 --> 25:11.760
Okay.

25:36.120 --> 25:37.520
The ointment works pretty well.

25:43.320 --> 25:44.600
Hurry up.

25:44.640 --> 25:45.800
Stop fussing about.

25:46.400 --> 25:47.240
Qing Ye's here.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.520
What are you doing out and about?

25:50.280 --> 25:51.520
My foot is pretty much healed.

25:51.600 --> 25:52.680
I came out to stroll around a bit.

25:53.040 --> 25:54.080
Are you hungry?

25:54.920 --> 25:55.240
Yes.

25:55.560 --> 25:56.880
I want to go to Yitong to order food.

25:57.200 --> 25:58.040
The owner's not there.

25:58.880 --> 25:59.760
Right here.

26:01.520 --> 26:02.200
What would you like to eat?

26:03.160 --> 26:03.960
You'd better write this down.

26:04.920 --> 26:06.080
For every meal: four dishes and one soup.

26:06.520 --> 26:07.360
For breakfast, half the portions.

26:07.520 --> 26:08.760
For breakfast, swap the soup for milk.

26:08.960 --> 26:09.680
For each meal,

26:09.680 --> 26:10.760
no fewer than two types of protein,

26:10.880 --> 26:11.920
no fewer than two types of vegetables,

26:12.000 --> 26:13.040
and no more than two types of carbohydrates.

26:13.520 --> 26:13.800
Yes.

26:14.080 --> 26:15.800
Make more foods that are easy to chew and swallow.

26:16.360 --> 26:17.840
And add a steamed egg with sea urchin.

26:18.560 --> 26:19.040
Oh, and...

26:19.440 --> 26:20.160
...your portions here—

26:20.160 --> 26:21.000
aren't they really big?

26:21.240 --> 26:22.520
I hope it's enough for two.

26:24.320 --> 26:25.320
So many requirements!

26:27.720 --> 26:28.680
Uh...

26:28.680 --> 26:30.040
I'm not doing business with you.

26:30.120 --> 26:31.280
Look, my business is doing

26:31.280 --> 26:32.000
just fine as it is.

26:32.000 --> 26:32.800
At mealtimes,

26:32.800 --> 26:34.520
I really can't handle any more.

26:37.560 --> 26:40.280
[Alipay received: one thousand yuan.]

26:44.440 --> 26:45.120
Even if too busy,

26:45.120 --> 26:46.520
I've got to prioritize your need, don't I?

26:47.840 --> 26:48.720
This is an advance payment.

26:48.960 --> 26:50.720
It covers processing and service fees.

26:50.880 --> 26:51.880
We'll settle the difference later.

26:52.000 --> 26:52.560
Okay, okay, okay.

26:52.640 --> 26:54.080
Your health is what's most important.

26:54.160 --> 26:55.320
Come on now, what are you eating?

26:55.360 --> 26:56.040
Tell me one more time.

26:56.280 --> 26:57.040
Shanxi,

26:57.320 --> 26:58.560
one order of Spanish mackerel dumplings, to go.

26:59.160 --> 27:00.080
You'll have to wait a bit.

27:00.480 --> 27:01.080
How are you back so quickly?

27:01.120 --> 27:01.640
Back already?

27:02.120 --> 27:02.720
None of your business.

27:04.080 --> 27:04.520
You said

27:05.160 --> 27:05.800
each meal

27:06.520 --> 27:08.520
four dishes and one soup.

27:11.960 --> 27:12.440
Grandma.

27:16.000 --> 27:16.960
Grandma, it's time to eat.

27:18.920 --> 27:20.080
I'm not hungry yet.

27:22.640 --> 27:23.720
Where did you go just now?

27:25.280 --> 27:26.000
Grandma,

27:27.680 --> 27:28.720
this morning I took Qing Ye

27:28.720 --> 27:29.680
to see the doctor.

27:30.400 --> 27:31.440
so I didn't come to bring you your meal.

27:32.600 --> 27:33.400
Here, Shanxi

27:33.400 --> 27:34.360
made these dumplings for you.

27:34.760 --> 27:35.320
Here, try some.

27:35.840 --> 27:36.280
Okay.

27:37.440 --> 27:37.840
Here.

27:38.920 --> 27:39.600
The vinegar smells so fragrant.

27:41.680 --> 27:42.360
Delicious.

27:43.720 --> 27:44.680
You know what?

27:45.640 --> 27:46.440
Now,

27:47.000 --> 27:48.760
besides you,

27:49.680 --> 27:51.280
I've also gained another granddaughter

27:51.280 --> 27:52.240
who's filial to me.

27:59.280 --> 28:01.040
Fruit! Fruit!

28:02.120 --> 28:04.040
Tofu!

28:04.680 --> 28:06.640
Fruit! Fruit!

28:07.040 --> 28:08.720
Tofu!

28:11.400 --> 28:12.000
Wu.

28:13.120 --> 28:13.520
Liu Nian.

28:14.320 --> 28:15.280
Why did you come out

28:15.280 --> 28:15.720
of Grandma's room?

28:15.960 --> 28:17.160
I'm doing housekeeping.

28:17.360 --> 28:17.800
Housekeeping?

28:18.440 --> 28:19.560
It's just helping with Grandma's room—

28:19.720 --> 28:21.000
dusting it off, wiping it down.

28:23.440 --> 28:24.280
Housekeeping is fine,

28:24.760 --> 28:25.400
just don't disturb Grandma.

28:25.880 --> 28:26.680
Don't worry, no problem.

29:06.760 --> 29:07.480
It's a small place, after all.

29:08.120 --> 29:08.920
Once the money's there,

29:09.520 --> 29:10.280
everything's a small matter.

29:11.360 --> 29:13.080
[Why didn't he take the money?]

29:32.000 --> 29:32.920
Cousin!

29:34.600 --> 29:36.120
Why are you yelling? I'm not your cousin!

29:37.320 --> 29:38.880
Now, now— don't be like that.

29:39.200 --> 29:41.120
First time strangers, second time friends.

29:41.200 --> 29:42.520
I'm actually a pretty good guy.

29:42.600 --> 29:43.760
You've got to get to know me more.

29:44.520 --> 29:44.840
Oh, right.

29:45.040 --> 29:45.840
Just now I went to the delivery station,

29:45.920 --> 29:46.560
saw your package,

29:46.600 --> 29:47.080
and brought it back for you.

29:47.320 --> 29:48.560
Okay, thanks.

29:49.800 --> 29:51.240
What's there to thank?

29:51.920 --> 29:52.720
Wu's cousin...

29:52.720 --> 29:53.680
...is my cousin.

29:53.960 --> 29:55.320
If you have any requests, just name them.

29:56.720 --> 29:57.520
Is there another place around here

29:57.520 --> 29:58.440
that sells fruit?

29:58.520 --> 29:59.360
I want to eat some fruit.

29:59.520 --> 30:00.640
Th-there's definitely a place!

30:00.640 --> 30:01.000
Look,

30:01.320 --> 30:02.400
we've got abundant produce here.

30:02.400 --> 30:03.320
We've got all kinds of fruit.

30:03.520 --> 30:04.320
What do you want? I'll buy it for you.

30:04.840 --> 30:06.520
I'd like to eat avocado and cherries.

30:07.560 --> 30:08.240
Can't get them?

30:08.520 --> 30:09.560
Impossible.

30:09.800 --> 30:10.400
Let me tell you,

30:10.680 --> 30:11.640
even if they were at the North Pole,

30:11.640 --> 30:12.720
I'd dive in and swim over

30:12.720 --> 30:13.360
and bring them back for you.

30:14.200 --> 30:14.760
Payment QR code.

30:15.240 --> 30:15.960
No need.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.280
Thanks, I received everything.

30:39.960 --> 30:41.040
[Make sure to hurry and get your things done]

30:41.040 --> 30:41.840
[to prepare for the start of classes.]

30:48.120 --> 30:49.520
You've just arrived— can you keep a low profile?

30:50.800 --> 30:51.680
How am I being high-profile?

30:54.080 --> 30:55.080
You just got here and you're already flaunting your wealth.

30:55.560 --> 30:56.000
Our place

30:56.000 --> 30:56.960
isn't like your big city.

30:57.280 --> 30:58.240
Be careful you may be targeted.

30:58.640 --> 30:59.800
Where did I flaunt my wealth?

31:00.560 --> 31:01.520
I wasn't showing off.

31:02.360 --> 31:04.360
I'm just normally paying for services.

31:05.600 --> 31:06.320
Besides, you people here—

31:06.320 --> 31:07.400
don't you like money?

31:08.600 --> 31:09.880
Thanks for the warning.

31:10.080 --> 31:11.640
How I spend my money is my business.

31:14.000 --> 31:14.720
Suit yourself.

31:35.360 --> 31:36.320
Hello, everyone.

31:36.360 --> 31:38.680
I am honored to introduce myself here.

31:38.880 --> 31:39.520
My name is

31:39.520 --> 31:40.080
[Xing Wu.]

31:40.600 --> 31:41.920
[Has your brain gone bad or what?]

31:44.840 --> 31:46.280
Xing Wu, come out here!

31:50.720 --> 31:51.960
Was it you who changed that door lock?

31:55.720 --> 31:57.320
Why should we have to change the lock?

31:58.000 --> 31:58.920
It's already installed.

31:58.960 --> 32:00.120
Nobody's making you pay for it.

32:00.640 --> 32:01.520
If a young girl is taking a shower

32:01.600 --> 32:02.680
and someone peeps at her, what then?

32:03.560 --> 32:05.600
Have you got water in your brain or something?

32:05.960 --> 32:06.600
I've showered here

32:06.600 --> 32:07.520
for all these years.

32:07.520 --> 32:08.640
Who's ever peeped?

32:08.800 --> 32:09.760
And what do you mean

32:09.760 --> 32:11.200
"nobody's making me pay"?

32:11.200 --> 32:12.400
Is that any way to talk to me?

32:12.400 --> 32:13.720
Isn't your money our family's money?

32:14.880 --> 32:15.680
How much was that lock?

32:15.840 --> 32:16.840
Wait. What are you going to do?

32:16.960 --> 32:18.440
I'm going to find people to split the cost!

32:19.040 --> 32:20.000
Is that really necessary?

32:20.920 --> 32:22.040
You spent hundreds on clothes

32:22.040 --> 32:23.000
and didn't seem to feel the pinch.

32:23.320 --> 32:24.240
It's just one lock!

32:24.920 --> 32:26.520
Necessary! Necessary! Necessary!

32:27.000 --> 32:28.400
Shower heads, water heaters,

32:28.400 --> 32:29.080
light bulbs—

32:29.080 --> 32:30.720
our family replaces the most of them.

32:31.320 --> 32:32.120
Do they remember us

32:32.120 --> 32:33.080
for any of the good we do?

32:33.520 --> 32:34.440
Last winter,

32:34.600 --> 32:36.160
Wu Laoer picked up a piece of scrap electrical wire

32:36.360 --> 32:37.200
and used it in our courtyard

32:37.200 --> 32:38.000
as a clothesline.

32:38.200 --> 32:39.200
And then, over ten yuan,

32:39.200 --> 32:40.560
he chased me around for a whole month demanding it!

32:40.840 --> 32:41.880
Why does it always have to be

32:41.880 --> 32:42.720
us footing the bill?

32:42.720 --> 32:44.400
Why is it always us, every single time?

32:44.760 --> 32:45.440
How much?

32:47.680 --> 32:48.600
Wh... what?

32:49.000 --> 32:49.840
How much was changing the lock?

32:50.080 --> 32:50.600
I'll pay.

32:51.360 --> 32:52.000
Is five hundred enough?

32:52.880 --> 32:53.240
No...

32:53.720 --> 32:54.280
Qing Ye...

32:57.080 --> 32:58.200
I didn't mean for you...

32:58.320 --> 33:01.000
Alipay received: five hundred yuan.

33:02.080 --> 33:02.880
It's just a lock!

33:03.520 --> 33:04.000
Is that really necessary?

33:07.440 --> 33:08.240
Just pretend I wanted it changed.

33:11.720 --> 33:12.200
No,

33:13.080 --> 33:14.160
we didn't mean for you

33:14.240 --> 33:15.880
to pay for it.

33:41.640 --> 33:42.720
I transferred the five hundred to you.

33:43.000 --> 33:43.760
Remember to accept it.

33:45.160 --> 33:45.640
No need.

33:53.720 --> 33:54.760
Li Lanfang argued with me

33:55.000 --> 33:55.600
because she feels like

33:55.600 --> 33:56.520
the neighbors are taking advantage of us.

33:56.600 --> 33:57.360
She feels it's unfair.

33:58.720 --> 33:59.720
It's not about the money at all.

34:01.640 --> 34:02.560
Anyway, I don't care either way.

34:03.160 --> 34:04.560
Just take it as me paying for some peace and quiet.

34:08.880 --> 34:09.440
Do you think

34:09.440 --> 34:10.120
all of us

34:10.120 --> 34:10.960
can be smoothed over with money?

34:13.760 --> 34:14.639
I didn't think that.

34:14.639 --> 34:16.120
That's exactly what your actions are saying.

34:16.560 --> 34:17.760
Well, think whatever you want, then.

34:20.080 --> 34:21.040
I'll be honest with you.

34:21.440 --> 34:22.600
Your mom told me to stay here.

34:22.719 --> 34:23.719
The reason you changed the lock for me—

34:24.239 --> 34:25.719
...wasn't it still because I gave you money?

34:29.760 --> 34:30.760
What do you take us for?

34:32.520 --> 34:33.239
Take you for what?

34:34.960 --> 34:36.040
Here, take a good look.

34:37.120 --> 34:38.800
Party A and Party B, signed and sealed.

34:39.280 --> 34:39.920
Take a look—

34:40.040 --> 34:41.040
I have never acknowledged

34:41.040 --> 34:42.400
a single word on this paper.

34:42.520 --> 34:43.400
Acknowledge it or not, I don't care.

34:43.639 --> 34:45.199
Even if you don't, it's still Party A and Party B.

34:45.520 --> 34:46.400
I paid money.

34:46.639 --> 34:47.560
So I deserve to have

34:47.560 --> 34:49.000
a quiet and comfortable environment.

34:49.560 --> 34:50.719
Just based on this attitude of yours,

34:51.520 --> 34:53.440
I could totally refuse to pay the final balance.

34:54.760 --> 34:55.520
Do you think that just because you have money,

34:55.520 --> 34:56.520
you can do whatever you want?

34:57.720 --> 34:58.400
Enjoying services,

34:58.400 --> 34:59.240
enjoying a vacation, is that right?

34:59.280 --> 35:00.000
Leave right now.

35:00.560 --> 35:01.880
Pack your things and go stay at a hotel.

35:09.840 --> 35:10.680
Fine, I'll leave.

35:12.160 --> 35:12.800
This lousy place—

35:12.800 --> 35:13.920
I don't want to stay here another second.

35:36.000 --> 35:36.520
Young lady,

35:36.920 --> 35:37.400
want a ride?

35:38.400 --> 35:38.800
Yes.

35:39.360 --> 35:39.800
Give it to me.

35:40.920 --> 35:41.280
Okay.

35:41.360 --> 35:41.920
Thanks.

35:44.280 --> 35:44.760
Hold on tight.

35:46.000 --> 35:46.560
Sit properly.

35:49.000 --> 35:49.640
Where are we headed?

35:50.080 --> 35:51.160
Just keep driving forward.

35:52.360 --> 35:53.840
Drive forward? We'll drive right into the sea!

35:55.680 --> 35:57.520
Then take me to this place—

35:57.560 --> 35:58.360
the best hotel.

35:58.520 --> 35:59.000
All right!

36:02.040 --> 36:02.600
Sit tight.

36:37.880 --> 36:39.680
[Family dinner— reunion and happiness.]

36:56.040 --> 36:56.920
Your turn!

36:58.520 --> 36:59.000
No...

37:00.120 --> 37:00.920
This bad?

37:07.320 --> 37:08.440
You go, bro!

37:27.360 --> 37:28.280
No, you go!

37:33.600 --> 37:34.160
Hello.

37:37.840 --> 37:38.560
Hello.

37:39.560 --> 37:40.080
Hello.

37:40.960 --> 37:41.640
Just a moment— wait a second.

37:41.680 --> 37:42.440
I've got a guest here.

37:43.120 --> 37:44.040
I'd like to book a room.

37:44.840 --> 37:46.160
You... you pick one.

37:55.240 --> 37:56.320
Five eighty-eight.

37:56.560 --> 37:58.160
Is this your best room type here?

37:58.320 --> 37:59.080
Of course.

37:59.360 --> 38:00.720
Five eighty-eight is our specialty—

38:00.800 --> 38:02.400
the Deluxe Ocean View Suite.

38:02.680 --> 38:03.520
In all of Zhazhating,

38:03.520 --> 38:04.400
you won't find a better one.

38:04.880 --> 38:05.760
There's air conditioning, right?

38:05.960 --> 38:06.760
Air conditioning, definitely.

38:06.920 --> 38:07.520
What about Wi-Fi?

38:07.720 --> 38:08.240
Wi-Fi...

38:09.720 --> 38:10.160
Miss,

38:11.120 --> 38:12.840
have you never stayed in a hotel before?

38:17.000 --> 38:18.080
Just hurry and check me in, please.

39:38.360 --> 39:40.240
Air conditioning, and no Xing Wu.

39:41.200 --> 39:42.960
Finally, I can get a good night's sleep.

39:52.200 --> 39:54.000
Qing Ye, I checked the weather forecast—

39:54.120 --> 39:55.320
is it raining over there?

39:56.520 --> 39:58.000
I found some prep course videos

39:58.120 --> 39:58.640
and materials.

39:58.760 --> 40:00.040
You can look them over during summer break.

40:01.080 --> 40:02.000
Okay, thanks.

40:22.400 --> 40:22.760
This...

40:23.520 --> 40:24.600
...the internet is down?

40:45.240 --> 40:45.720
Wu.

40:47.280 --> 40:47.920
Coming, Liu Nian.

40:50.680 --> 40:51.120
Wu.

40:52.880 --> 40:53.320
Wu.

40:54.520 --> 40:55.000
Wu.

40:56.920 --> 40:57.880
I've brought your meal.

40:58.120 --> 40:58.520
Okay.

40:58.560 --> 41:00.120
This is what Qing Ye ordered from my mom earlier—

41:00.120 --> 41:00.720
the special meal.

41:00.920 --> 41:01.720
Enough for two people.

41:03.720 --> 41:04.280
Thanks.

41:05.520 --> 41:05.960
Well, you...

41:06.680 --> 41:07.520
...hurry and eat.

41:07.600 --> 41:08.120
Okay.

41:10.120 --> 41:10.720
Bye-bye, Liu Nian.

41:10.720 --> 41:11.440
Okay, bye.

41:31.120 --> 41:32.680
Make more foods that are easy to chew and swallow.

41:33.320 --> 41:35.000
And add a steamed egg with sea urchin.

41:36.040 --> 41:36.640
You people here—

41:36.640 --> 41:37.800
aren't your portions especially large?

41:37.960 --> 41:39.200
It'd be best if it's enough for two people.

41:39.680 --> 41:41.400
It's not just you who's filial—

41:42.320 --> 41:44.120
I've also gained another granddaughter

41:44.240 --> 41:45.280
who's filial to me.

41:52.960 --> 41:53.400
Wu.

41:55.560 --> 41:55.920
Wu.

41:56.960 --> 41:58.240
I've finished the cleaning.

41:58.400 --> 41:59.120
I'll head out now.

41:59.800 --> 42:00.240
Okay.

42:00.600 --> 42:01.360
Remember to take an umbrella.

42:01.400 --> 42:01.760
Okay.

42:01.760 --> 42:02.480
It's going to rain— don't forget.

42:08.720 --> 42:09.240
Wu.

42:09.400 --> 42:10.880
Let me add a little extra word here—

42:11.600 --> 42:12.520
...actually...

42:13.520 --> 42:14.600
...Qing Ye is pretty great.

42:16.800 --> 42:17.240
What,

42:18.200 --> 42:19.000
did she buy you off?

42:19.160 --> 42:19.960
No.

42:20.000 --> 42:20.760
How could that be?

42:21.040 --> 42:21.800
Here's the thing.

42:22.320 --> 42:23.520
Would you like to earn a little extra cash on the side?

42:23.840 --> 42:24.520
Extra cash?

42:25.040 --> 42:25.680
What extra cash?

42:26.920 --> 42:28.200
I was just thinking, I want you to help me

42:28.520 --> 42:29.960
clean up the rooms upstairs,

42:30.120 --> 42:31.080
and also Grandma's room.

42:31.080 --> 42:32.160
Especially Grandma's room—

42:32.360 --> 42:33.600
make sure you get all that dust,

42:33.600 --> 42:34.600
wipe everything clean.

42:34.840 --> 42:35.880
Isn't Grandma sick?

42:36.000 --> 42:37.720
All that dust and bad air is bad for her health.

42:39.160 --> 42:40.560
Also, buy some green plants and put them in her room.

42:44.160 --> 42:45.200
I'll be off now, Wu.

43:01.520 --> 43:02.080
What's up?

43:02.600 --> 43:03.960
Late at night, you've come to your senses?

43:04.040 --> 43:04.800
Hello, Teacher Zhu.

43:05.160 --> 43:05.920
Um, was it you...

43:05.920 --> 43:06.600
...who, outside my house,

43:06.600 --> 43:07.600
picked up a girl?

43:07.800 --> 43:08.360
That's right.

43:08.520 --> 43:10.160
There was a girl with a suitcase.

43:10.320 --> 43:10.840
Yes, yes, yes.

43:10.960 --> 43:11.600
Where did she go?

43:12.200 --> 43:13.320
Zhazha Grand Court.

43:20.720 --> 43:21.400
Hello, Hao.

43:22.040 --> 43:23.720
Is there a girl named Qing Ye

43:23.880 --> 43:24.640
in your place?

43:26.560 --> 43:27.200
Checked in?

43:27.960 --> 43:28.800
Ocean view suite.

43:29.160 --> 43:30.360
Could you look after her for me?

43:31.200 --> 43:32.200
If anything comes up, contact me.

43:33.640 --> 43:34.040
Okay.

43:34.760 --> 43:35.360
Thanks.
